  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut the carrot and zucchini into thin half-moons.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat then roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126f9bd705a72409f763e8a/step-171f3c21.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, thinly slice the red onion. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Reduce the heat to medium and add the balsamic vinegar, water and brown sugar. Mix well and cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126f9bd705a72409f763e8a/step-11836ea6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the onions are cooking, finely chop the garlic. Cut or tear the bake-at-home ciabatta into 2cm chunks. On a second lined oven tray, combine the ciabatta, garlic and a generous drizzle of olive oil. Sprinkle over the 1/2 the grated Parmesan cheese. Bake until golden, 5-8 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126f9bd705a72409f763e8a/step-f8ea5142.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the croutons are baking, pat the haloumi dry and cut into 1cm-thick pieces. In a large bowl, combine the haloumi, Aussie spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Wipe out the frying pan and return to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook the haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• TIP: The spice blend will char slightly in the pan, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126f9bd705a72409f763e8a/step-80828468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine the ranch dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Season, then add the mixed salad leaves, roast veggies, garlic croutons and Aussie haloumi. Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126f9bd705a72409f763e8a/step-fd76664b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the chicken. Divide the garlic crouton salad between plates. Top with the Aussie chicken, spooning over any resting juices. Spoon the caramelised onions over the chicken. Sprinkle over the remaining Parmesan to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6126f9bd705a72409f763e8a/step-a7ff8a9f.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
